    {
      "data": {
        "text": "<thinking> To complete the task, I need to create a Python file named `profile_claims.py` that fetches and normalizes federated user profile claims using a concrete external provider. The provider must be identifiable in the code. I will use the Google People API as the external provider for fetching user profile claims. The Google People API is a concrete external provider that can be identified by its specific client class and API endpoint. </thinking>\n\n",
        "time": {
          "end": 1789863370532,
          "start": 1789863366888
        },
        "type": "text"
