      "data": {
        "text": "<thinking> To handle the OAuth callback and exchange an authorization code for tokens, I need to choose a concrete external provider. I'll use Google as the provider for this task. The code will import the necessary Google-specific libraries and use Google's OAuth2 endpoints to exchange the authorization code for tokens. </thinking>\n",
